<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51310" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Volsĭnĭi</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vulsĭnĭi</span></b> ),
			ōrum, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in Etruria</i>, now <i>Bolsena</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 52,
				53, § 139</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 10,
				37, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">27, 23,
				3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 3, 191</span></i>.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Volsĭnĭus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Volsinii</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foci,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				4</span></i>
			 (5), 2, 4.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Volsĭnĭensis</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vuls-</span></b> ), e,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Volsinii</i>, <i>Volsinian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					5, 32, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">provincia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 5, 32, 4, § 2</span></i>
			: lacus, <i>a lake lying south of the town</i>,
			now <i>Lago di Bolsena</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 8, 16,
				2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 36, 22, 49, §
				168</span></i>.—<i>Plur. subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Volsĭnĭen-ses</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Vuls-</span></b> ),
			ĭum, m., <i>the
				inhabitants of Volsinii</i>, <i>Volsinians</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				3, 5, 8, § 52</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 5, 31
				sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 3
			al.</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
